<title>USA: Lynch explores multimedia spinoff.</title>
<headline>Lynch explores multimedia spinoff.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lynch Corp said on Friday that it is exploring the possibility of a spinoff of its multimedia operations with the Morgan Group Inc subsidiary to shareholders.</p>
<p>The combined units would be called Lynch Interactive Corp, the company said.</p>
<p>The multimedia operations include telecommunications, cable television, broadcasting and Lynch's current interests in personal communications services, Lynch said.</p>
